      "content": "Each gap now scans the entire `stored` array to find its revision. With G gaps and R stored sessions, recovery adds O(G × R) work per instrument (quadratic for histories with a mix of saved and missing sessions), synchronously inside the read transaction. Build a date-to-record/revision Map once alongside `resolutionOf` and use constant-time lookups when constructing `revisions`.",
