      "path": "src/ui/screens/ReviewView.tsx",
      "content": "Changing pages unmounts the current MarkEntry components, whose prices and reasons exist only in local state. Entering a price, pressing Next page, then returning therefore silently loses the draft; onDirtyChange only defers release updates and does not protect this transition. Preserve drafts across pages, or require saving/cancelling (or explicit discard confirmation) before changing pages. Add a test that types a value before paging away and back.",
