    {
      "path": "src/ui/screens/ReviewView.tsx",
      "content": "Continue remains enabled while this read is pending, so repeated clicks can run multiple opens concurrently. Responses are applied in arrival order: an older snapshot can overwrite a newer one, or a late failure can display a refresh error after the walk has successfully opened. Track an in-flight request and disable the button, or ignore superseded responses; cover out-of-order results with deferred promises.",
