    {
      "path": "src/ui/screens/ReviewView.tsx",
      "content": "A successful refresh does not update existing MarkEntry state for an unchanged instrument/date key. MarkEntry initializes its resolution and revision with useState and does not synchronize subsequent props, while TodayRow retains the same key here. If another tab saves or corrects a Mark before Continue is pressed, the refreshed status and Trade walk use the new snapshot but the Mark still shows the old value and saves against the old revision. Reconcile refreshed resolutions/revisions into entries without discarding active drafts, and test a refresh that changes a Mark for the same date.",
